TITLE 1D transport 10 cells 10 shifts; Na-Ca exchange

SOLUTION 0  Infilling
    pH 7.0
    units mol/kgw
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10  Initial
    pH 7.0
    units mol/kgw
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001

EQUILIBRATE 1-10 with_solution 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step NaX_ex4
10 PUNCH SIM_NO, MOL("NaX")

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -lengths 1
    -time_step 1
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -dispersivities 0
    -punch_frequency 1
    -print_cells 4
END
